#!/bin/bash
#
# Abbey Root Tool: abbey-ansible-update
#
# Purpose:
# Deprecated compatibility command. Linux patching is performed with
# abbey lab patch.
#
# Usage:
# abbey-ansible-update
#

cat <<'MESSAGE'
abbey-ansible-update is deprecated.

The supported Abbey Root Linux patch workflow is:

  abbey lab patch

To validate patch readiness without installing updates or rebooting:

  abbey lab patch --preflight-only

The old update command has been disabled because it bypassed the patch
workflow's preflight checks, deterministic host ordering, reboot validation,
failure handling, reporting, and controller exclusion.
MESSAGE

exit 2
